  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The % yield of ammonia as a function of time in the reaction<br ><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo><</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> is given below.<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image59-721fdf44-1a89-4732-b952-30657c3b1f1c.jpg\"/><br >If this reaction is conducted at <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>></mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> , the % yield of ammonia as a function of time is represented by:</p>",
